    "description": "List actual audio track IDs, part/instrument identities and the score's default mix output values for the full score or an explicit excerpt. Every instrument track of every part is listed (multi-instrument parts and instrument changes produce one entry per instrument) plus chord-symbol tracks, which are flagged and always muted because chord playback is off. trackId is the zero-based index in this deterministic list and is the id accepted by the export mix option. An excerpt lists only the tracks of that excerpt's parts. Defaults come from the source MSCZ audiosettings.json when present, otherwise they are neutral; forceMute is derived from solo. Requires no SoundFont.",
